    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the tip. I'll try watering it less. I'm also worried because some of the leaves look kinda spotty or mottled too, not just plain yellow. Could that be something else like a lack of nutrients? I haven't fertilized it in a few months.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
