    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'll grab some fertilizer this weekend. One more thing though—I noticed it's mostly happening in the darker corner of the room. Do you think it's just getting too little light, or is there something more \"mysterious\" about why it's failing specifically in that spot?",
